{"t":"Purple Kiss Bush","s":"purple-kiss-bush-f355e","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Purple_Kiss_Bush_9272e9.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Purple Kiss Bush</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Purple Kiss Bush\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Purple_Kiss_Bush_9272e9.gif\" width=\"64\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Flora and Minerals<br/>Bushes<br/>Jungle Plants</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"pickupable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickupable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"immobile\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Movable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7.5<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">August 09, 2005<br/>Summer Update 2005</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20091223135857&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Purple_Kiss_Bush_9272e9.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a purple kiss bush.<div class=\"p-weight\"></div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>All over the <a href=\"#/wiki/Tiquanda\">jungle</a>, around <a href=\"#/wiki/Liberty%20Bay\">Liberty Bay</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Meriana\">Meriana</a>, Meluna, <a href=\"#/wiki/Earth%20Sphere\">Earth Sphere</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Chazorai\">Chazorai</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>It seems impossible to cultivate it, so it's only seen in wild. It is quoted in this book.<br/><br/>If you cut this bush you get <a href=\"#/wiki/Purple%20Kiss%20Blossom\">Purple Kiss Blossom</a>, which is needed for <a href=\"#/quest/the-ice-islands-quest\">The Ice Islands Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li>Bushes</li><li>Flora and Minerals</li><li>Jungle Plants</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Purple%20Kiss%20Blossom\">Purple Kiss Blossom</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/the-ice-islands-quest\">The Ice Islands Quest</a></li><li>Wondrous Plant Life - Jungle Edition II (Book)</li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["the-ice-islands-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"the-ice-islands-quest","quest":"The Ice Islands Quest","step":"5-0","n":20,"title":"Falar com o Nilsor","kind":"mention","coords":[{"x":32329,"y":31044,"z":7,"label":"Nilsor"}]},{"slug":"the-ice-islands-quest","quest":"The Ice Islands Quest","step":"5-8","n":28,"title":"Purple Kiss Blossom","kind":"mention","coords":[]}]}}